  "description": "The WDS Audit SDK provides a simple and extensible .NET client for sending immutable audit events\n      to the Audit Collector service. It integrates seamlessly with Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection\n      and IConfiguration, supports configuration via environment variables or appsettings, and enables\n      strongly-typed creation and transmission of AuditEnvelope objects. This SDK enforces consistency,\n      versioning, and tamper-resistant audit logging across distributed applications.",
